<BaseLayout title="About | Jon's Game Guides">
<section class="hero"><div class="container narrow"><div class="kicker">About the library</div><h1>Built to answer the question I have while I'm actually playing.</h1><p class="hero-copy">This is a personal, evolving reference library—not a news site and not a giant generic wiki. Guides are organized around practical decisions: what to do next, what to farm, what to keep, how to approach a boss, and which upgrades matter most.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container info-grid">
<div class="info-card"><span>01</span><h3>Practical first</h3><p>Fast answers, progression priorities, checklists, and decision rules come before encyclopedic detail.</p></div>
<div class="info-card"><span>02</span><h3>Living guides</h3><p>Seasonal and stage-specific pages are updated as the games, builds, and playthroughs change.</p></div>
<div class="info-card"><span>03</span><h3>One home</h3><p>The same site can hold game guides, build notes, progression plans, and eventually playable projects such as Evolution.</p></div>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>